  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">LELF</a>&#160;= .TRUE. | .FALSE.<br /> Default: <b>LELF</b> = .FALSE.&#160;\n</p><p>Description: <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">LELF</a> determines whether to create an\n<a href=\"/wiki/ELFCAR\" title=\"ELFCAR\">ELFCAR</a> file or not.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This file contains the so-called ELF (electron localization\nfunction) <sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-silvi:nature:371&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-silvi:nature:371-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>If <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">LELF</a> is set, <a href=\"/wiki/NPAR\" title=\"NPAR\">NPAR</a>=1 has to be set explicitely in\nthe <a href=\"/wiki/INCAR\" title=\"INCAR\">INCAR</a> file in addition\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_tags_and_articles\">Related tags and articles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LELF&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Related tags and articles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LELF&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Related tags and articles\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/NPAR\" title=\"NPAR\">NPAR</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Special:Search/%22LELF%22_incategory:%22Examples%22\" title=\"Special:Search/&quot;LELF&quot; incategory:&quot;Examples&quot;\">Examples that use this tag</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LELF&amp;veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LELF&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: References\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-silvi:nature:371-1\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-silvi:nature:371_1-0\">↑</a> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nature.com/nature/journal/v371/n6499/pdf/371683a0.pdf\">B. Silvi and A. Savin, Nature 371, 683-686 (1994).</a></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260717124219\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.008 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 147/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 360/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 562/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    4.174      1 -total\n 17.61%    0.735      4 Template:TAG\n 17.30%    0.722      1 Template:TAGDEF\n  7.48%    0.312      1 Template:Sc\n  6.32%    0.264      2 Template:FILE\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key mediawiki-vw:pcache:idhash:297-0!canonical and timestamp 20260717124219 and revision id 27202. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
